  "summary": "作者以父母遗传及体质差异说明疾病推论需引父母资料，并述紫云太岁入宫法由婚姻扩及疾病、人际与建筑方位。方法将特定关系人的生年太岁引入命造盘，按关系事项分析个别差异，末预告两个健康例；非本块已验证医学预测。",
  "summary_en": "The author motivates using parental data in disease interpretation through inherited constitution and individual differences. Zi Yun’s Tai Sui Ru Gong Fa is described as extending from marriage to health, interpersonal relations and building orientation. It uses a relevant person’s birth-year Tai Sui in the subject’s chart for the particular relationship at issue. Two health examples are announced, not analyzed here; the passage does not establish validated medical prediction.",
